```spl
`SOC Lab Detection Rule`
`Rule Name: Windows User Account Lockout Monitoring`
`Event ID: 4740 (A user account was locked out)`
`MITRE ATT&CK: T1110.001 (Password Guessing - DoS byproduct)`
`Severity: Medium`
`Data Source: WinEventLog:Security | index=blue`
`Description: Identifies locked-out accounts following threshold violations and tracks the calling machine generating the lockouts.`
```

index=blue EventCode=4740
| eval Locked_Account=coalesce(TargetUserName,user)
| eval Caller=coalesce(CallerComputerName,"Unknown")
| stats count AS Lockout_Count earliest(_time) AS First_Lockout latest(_time) AS Last_Lockout by host Locked_Account Caller
| convert ctime(First_Lockout) ctime(Last_Lockout)
| table Last_Lockout host Locked_Account Caller Lockout_Count
| sort - Lockout_Count
